[{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070100_03_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070100_03_0010","text":"啊，那个……难道是————"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070100_03_0001","text":"舞蹈教练"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070100_03_0020","text":"抱歉——！迟到了5秒——！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070100_03_0030","text":"早上好"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070100_03_0040","text":"……！\n早、早上好！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070100_03_0002","text":"舞蹈教练"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070100_03_0050","text":"那，我们马上开始吧！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070100_03_0060","text":"好的……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070100_03_0061","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070100_03_0062","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070100_03_0070","text":"（啊……又是这首曲子————）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070100_03_0003","text":"舞蹈教练"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070100_03_0080","text":"稍微等一下，抱歉。我先停一下！\n……日花酱，怎么回事？上次明明能弹好的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070100_03_0090","text":"对不起……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070100_03_0004","text":"舞蹈教练"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070100_03_0100","text":"不用道歉\n想想做不到的原因吧？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070100_03_0110","text":"是、是的……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070100_03_0120","text":"——那个，我觉得是\n注意力涣散了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070100_03_0005","text":"舞蹈教练"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070100_03_0130","text":"那已经是练习之前的问题了哦"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070100_03_0140","text":"对不起……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070100_03_0006","text":"舞蹈教练"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070100_03_0150","text":"——总之，今天就到这里吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070100_03_0007","text":"舞蹈教练"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070100_03_0160","text":"但是，今天落下的部分\n不代表以后一定能补回来哦"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070100_03_0008","text":"舞蹈教练"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070100_03_0170","text":"这一点，希望你能好好意识到呢\n——那么，辛苦了——"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070100_03_0180","text":"辛苦了……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070100_03_0190","text":"……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070100_03_0191","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070100_03_0200","text":"那我也回去了\n辛苦了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070100_03_0210","text":"啊，好的……\n辛苦了……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070100_03_0211","text":"Motion"}]
